              "name": "Aura of Warding",
              "level": 7,
              "description": "<p>Ancient magic lies so heavily upon you that it forms an eldritch ward, blunting energy from beyond the Material Plane; you and your allies have Resistance to Necrotic, Psychic, and Radiant damage while in your Aura of Protection.</p>",
