              "name": "Undying Sentinel",
              "level": 15,
              "description": "<p>When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points and not killed outright, you can drop to 1 Hit Point instead, and you regain a number of Hit Points equal to three times your Paladin level. Once you use this feature, you can’t do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>Additionally, you can’t be aged magically, and you cease visibly aging.</p>",
