          "key": "oath-of-vengeance",
          "name": "Oath of Vengeance",
          "description": "<p>Punish evildoers at any cost. The Oath of Vengeance is a solemn commitment to punish those who have committed grievously evil acts. When evil armies slaughter helpless villagers, when a tyrant defies the will of the gods, when a thieves’ guild grows too violent, when a dragon rampages through the countryside—at times like these, paladins arise and swear an Oath of Vengeance to set right that which has gone wrong.</p>",
