              "name": "Oath of Vengeance Spells",
              "level": 3,
              "description": "<p>The magic of your oath ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Paladin level specified in the Oath of Vengeance Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><ul><li>Level 3: Bane, Hunter’s Mark</li><li>Level 5: Hold Person, Misty Step</li><li>Level 9: Haste, Protection from Energy</li><li>Level 13: Banishment, Dimension Door</li><li>Level 17: Hold Monster, Scrying</li></ul>",
