              "key": "oath-of-vengeance.vow-of-enmity",
              "name": "Vow of Enmity",
              "level": 3,
              "description": "<p>When you take the Attack action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to utter a vow of enmity against a creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself. You have Advantage on attack rolls against the creature for 1 minute or until you use this feature again.</p><p>If the creature drops to 0 Hit Points before the vow ends, you can transfer the vow to a different creature within 30 feet of yourself (no action required).</p>"
            },
            {
